{
  "@context": {
    "@vocab": "https://danbri.github.io/glitchcan-minigam/inklet/finkapp/apps/vocab#"
  },
  "@id": "podnotes",
  "@type": "App",
  "position": 32,
  "id": "podnotes",
  "family": "office",
  "icon": "🗒️",
  "name": "Notes",
  "surface": "window",
  "url": "../apps/podnotes/index.html",
  "desc": "Plain notes, kept in your PodStore",
  "capabilities": [
    "pod:read",
    "pod:write"
  ],
  "silent": true,
  "notes": [
    "The first caller of the pod verbs (foaf.pod.get/list/put/delete in inklet/apps/app-sdk.js). It reaches only apps/podnotes/ in the pod the person marked \"apps use this\" in the Pods panel, and never sees the pod's address or password. Saves send the ETag it read, so a note changed elsewhere is not overwritten."
  ]
}
